minaret:VerseOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0005_38_46_2_196 a minaret:VerseOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 129.02 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "وَاَتِمُّوا الْحَجَّ وَالْعُمْرَةَ لِلّٰهِ ؕ فَاِنْ اُحْصِرْتُمْ فَمَا اسْتَیْسَرَ مِنَ الْهَدْیِ ۚ وَلَا تَحْلِقُوْا رُءُوْسَكُمْ حَتّٰی یَبْلُغَ الْهَدْیُ مَحِلَّهٗ ؕ فَمَنْ كَانَ مِنْكُمْ مَّرِیْضًا اَوْ بِهٖۤ اَذًی مِّنْ رَّأْسِهٖ فَفِدْیَةٌ مِّنْ صِیَامٍ اَوْ صَدَقَةٍ اَوْ نُسُكٍ ۚ فَاِذَاۤ اَمِنْتُمْ ٝ فَمَنْ تَمَتَّعَ بِالْعُمْرَةِ اِلَی الْحَجِّ فَمَا اسْتَیْسَرَ مِنَ الْهَدْیِ ۚ فَمَنْ لَّمْ یَجِدْ فَصِیَامُ ثَلٰثَةِ اَیَّامٍ فِی الْحَجِّ وَسَبْعَةٍ اِذَا رَجَعْتُمْ ؕ تِلْكَ عَشَرَةٌ كَامِلَةٌ ؕ ذٰلِكَ لِمَنْ لَّمْ یَكُنْ اَهْلُهٗ حَاضِرِی الْمَسْجِدِ الْحَرَامِ ؕ وَاتَّقُوا اللّٰهَ وَاعْلَمُوْۤا اَنَّ اللّٰهَ شَدِیْدُ الْعِقَابِ ۟" ;
    minaret:hasExtentType minaret:CompleteCitation ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_38_46_129_02 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:QuranVerse_2_196 ;
    minaret:startTime 38.46 .

minaret:VerseOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0006_171_44_2_196 a minaret:VerseOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 235.4 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "And complete the Hajj and Umrah for Allah. But if you are prevented, then offer what can be obtained with ease of sacrificial animals. And do not shave your heads until the sacrificial animal has reached its place of slaughter. And whoever among you is ill or has an ailment of the head, making shaving necessary, must offer a ransom of fasting three days, or charity, or sacrifice. And when you are secure, then whoever performs Umrah during the Hajj months, followed by Hajj offers what can be obtained with ease of sacrificial animals. And whoever cannot find or afford such an animal, then a fast of three days during Hajj and of seven when you have returned home. Those are ten complete days. This is for those whose family is not in the area of Al-Masjid Al-Haram. And fear Allah and know that Allah is severe in penalty." ;
    minaret:hasExtentType minaret:CompleteCitation ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_171_44_235_4 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:QuranVerse_2_196 ;
    minaret:startTime 171.44 .

minaret:VerseOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0007_130_5_2_197 a minaret:VerseOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 169.94 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "اَلْحَجُّ اَشْهُرٌ مَّعْلُوْمٰتٌ ۚ فَمَنْ فَرَضَ فِیْهِنَّ الْحَجَّ فَلَا رَفَثَ وَلَا فُسُوْقَ وَلَا جِدَالَ فِی الْحَجِّ ؕ وَمَا تَفْعَلُوْا مِنْ خَیْرٍ یَّعْلَمْهُ اللّٰهُ ؕ وَتَزَوَّدُوْا فَاِنَّ خَیْرَ الزَّادِ التَّقْوٰی ۖ وَاتَّقُوْنِ یٰۤاُولِی الْاَلْبَابِ ۟" ;
    minaret:hasExtentType minaret:CompleteCitation ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Quotation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_130_5_169_94 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:QuranVerse_2_197 ;
    minaret:startTime 130.5 .

minaret:VerseOccurrence_HAJJLT22-7041_0008_235_4_2_197 a minaret:VerseOccurrence ;
    minaret:endTime 259.78 ;
    minaret:evidenceText "Hajj is during well-known months. So whoever has made Hajj obligatory upon himself therein, by entering the state of Ihram, there is to be from him no sexual relations and no disobedience and no disputing during Hajj. And whatever good you do, Allah knows it. And take provisions. But indeed, the best provision is fear of Allah. And fear me, O you of understanding." ;
    minaret:hasExtentType minaret:CompleteCitation ;
    minaret:hasUsageType minaret:Translation ;
    minaret:occursIn minaret:SegmentGroup_HAJJLT22-7041_235_4_259_78 ;
    minaret:refersTo minaret:QuranVerse_2_197 ;
    minaret:startTime 235.4 .

