minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0000 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 10.62 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0001 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 0 ;
    minaret:startTime 0.0 ;
    minaret:text "لَبَّیْكَ اَللّٰهُمَّ لَبَّیْكَ، لَبَّیْكَ لَا شَرِیْكَ لَكَ لَبَّیْكَ، اِنَّ الْحَمْدَ، وَالنِّعْمَةَ" .

minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0004 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 53.92 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0005 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 4 ;
    minaret:startTime 44.28 ;
    minaret:text "اَللّٰهُمَّ لَبَّیْكَ، لَبَّیْكَ لَا شَرِیْكَ لَكَ لَبَّیْكَ، اِنَّ الْحَمْدَ، وَالنِّعْمَةَ" .

minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0005 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 63.82 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0006 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 5 ;
    minaret:startTime 53.92 ;
    minaret:text "لَكَ وَالْمُلْكَ، لَاشَرِیْكَ لَكَ۔ اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ وَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ. اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ." .

minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0006 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 78.4 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0007 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 6 ;
    minaret:startTime 63.82 ;
    minaret:text "Assalamu alaykum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh everyone. We welcome you to a very beautiful course because it is about Hajj. Hajj is beautiful, that's why this course Insha'Allah we're gonna hope that it is going to turn beautiful for all of us." .

minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0007 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 93.6 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0008 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 7 ;
    minaret:startTime 78.4 ;
    minaret:text "May Allah enable us to go for Hajj over and over again, Ameen. So Alhamdulillah, really good to see all of you here. So is everyone ready to begin? Alhamdulillah. Is there anyone going for Hajj this year? Or planning to go for Hajj this year? Making du'as to go for Hajj this year?" .

minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0008 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 103.54 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0009 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 8 ;
    minaret:startTime 93.6 ;
    minaret:text "اَلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ. اَلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ. May Allah enable all of us to go there over and over again, Ameen. So if not this year, Insha'Allah next year, right? Don't worry. So make a plan, start saving up for it," .

minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0009 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 109.8 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0010 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 9 ;
    minaret:startTime 103.54 ;
    minaret:text "and Insha'Allah don't just rely on your own means, rely on Allah Subhanahu wa Ta'ala; He can take you there." .

minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0010 a minaret:TranscriptSegment ;
    minaret:endTime 120.06 ;
    minaret:precedesSegment minaret:Segment_HAJJLT22-7038_0011 ;
    minaret:sequenceIndex 10 ;
    minaret:startTime 110.39999999999999 ;
    minaret:text "SubhanAllah. All right, so let's begin properly. اِنَّ الْحَمْدَ لِلّٰهِ، نَحْمَدُهٗ وَنَسْتَعِیْنُهٗ وَنَسْتَغْفِرُهٗ، وَنَعُوْذُ بِاللّٰهِ مِنْ شُرُوْرِ اَنْفُسِنَا" .

