    minaret:text "wonder what's that, so that's one way to understand Al-Hajj Al-Mabroor, and Insha'Allah in future we'll talk about it more. So what's the reward of Al-Hajj Al-Mabroor? Nothing but Jannah. Rasulullah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam" .

